    title: "Linux 核心交換層優化：解決快取與持久化交換檔案資源分配效率低下的問題",
    summary: "Linux 核心的交換（swap）層在過去一年經歷了重大改動，解決了多個長期存在的問題。然而，目前主線程式碼（mainline）仍未解決的核心問題，是交換快取（swap cache）中的槽位與持久化交換檔案（persistent swap files）中的空間之間存在直接的關聯性。這種直接關聯性可能導致系統資源使用效率極低。目前社群討論中存在兩種相互競爭的解決方案，但兩者都尚未達到可合併的準備狀態。這顯示開發團隊對於最佳的解決路徑仍存在持續的意見分歧，影響了交換層的資源管理優化。",
    tags: ["Linux 核心", "swap cache", "persistent swap files", "資源管理", "Linux 核心開發"],
    title_en: "Linux Kernel Swap Layer Optimization: Addressing Resource Allocation Inefficiency Between Cache and Persistent Swap Files",
    summary_en: "The Linux kernel's swap layer has undergone significant changes over the past year, resolving several long-standing issues. However, a core problem that the mainline code has yet to solve is the direct correlation between the slots in the swap cache and the space available in persistent swap files. This direct correlation can lead to extremely low system resource utilization efficiency. Currently, two competing solutions exist in community discussions, but neither has reached a state ready for merging. This indicates ongoing disagreement within the development team regarding the optimal path forward, affecting the resource management optimization of the swap layer.",
    tags_en: ["Linux Kernel", "swap cache", "persistent swap files", "resource management", "Linux Kernel Development"],
