    title: "Windows Search 預覽版升級，新增「動作」功能，讓用戶可直接執行系統指令",
    summary: "微軟發布了 Windows Search 的最新預覽功能，旨在提供更快速、更精簡的搜尋體驗。除了傳統的資訊檢索外，新版本還加入了「Actions」（動作）功能，允許用戶直接透過搜尋欄執行系統指令或更改設定。例如，用戶可以直接輸入「mute」來靜音喇叭，或輸入「minimise all my windows」來執行「Show Desktop」動作。此外，搜尋介面也進行了優化，使其更專注於結果展示，並改善了對錯別字和同義詞的處理能力。此功能基於 WinUI 3 構建，微軟聲稱在效能和記憶體使用上有顯著提升。目前這仍是英文預覽版，正逐步向 Windows Insiders 的 Experimental 通道推送，有資格的用戶可透過 Windows Insider Program 的 Feature flags 進行提前啟用。",
    tags: ["Windows Search", "WinUI 3", "Windows Insider", "系統指令", "使用者介面"],
    title_en: "Windows Search Preview Upgrade Adds 'Actions' Feature, Allowing Users to Execute System Commands Directly",
    summary_en: "Microsoft has released the latest preview features for Windows Search, aiming to provide a faster and more streamlined search experience. In addition to traditional information retrieval, the new version introduces an 'Actions' feature, which allows users to execute system commands or change settings directly through the search bar. For example, a user can directly type 'mute' to silence the speakers, or type 'minimise all my windows' to perform a 'Show Desktop' action. Furthermore, the search interface has been optimized to focus more on result display, and its ability to handle typos and synonyms has been improved. This feature is built on WinUI 3, and Microsoft claims significant improvements in performance and memory usage. Currently, this is still an English preview version, gradually being pushed to the Windows Insiders Experimental channel. Eligible users can enable it early through the Windows Insider Program's Feature flags.",
    tags_en: ["Windows Search", "WinUI 3", "Windows Insider", "System Commands", "User Interface"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/os-platforms/2026/10/08/windows-search-learns-to-take-orders/5301902", lang: "EN" }
    ]
