    category: "Windows",
    title: "微軟重申 Copilot+ PC 戰略：透過「混合智慧」結合本地與雲端 AI 提升用戶體驗",
    summary: "儘管市場曾預期 Copilot+ PC 品牌將逐漸淡出，但在 10 月 7 日的 Windows 與 Surface 活動上，微軟透過 Pavan Davuluri 的發言，再次強調 Copilot+ PC 的重要性。微軟宣布，Copilot+ PC 將具備「混合智慧」（Hybrid Intelligence）功能，讓 Copilot 能夠在本地端和雲端之間切分 AI 任務。這項技術提供三項關鍵本地能力：本地上下文理解（Local context）、本地動作執行（Local actions）以及本地模型（Local models）。這使 Copilot 不僅能理解本地文件和活動，還能代表用戶執行文件移動、設定更改等動作，並利用本地運算資源來減少對雲端 API 的依賴，從而節省 Token 使用量。這項轉變將 Copilot+ PC 定位為「日常 AI 的個人電腦」，而非僅僅是搭載 NPU 的硬體規格。然而，微軟提醒，具體功能和可用性仍取決於設備、市場和晶片平台，用戶需留意不同 Copilot+ PC 的差異。",
    tags: ["Copilot+ PC", "Microsoft", "Windows 11", "Hybrid Intelligence", "NPU", "AI"],
    title_en: "Microsoft Reaffirms Copilot+ PC Strategy: Enhancing User Experience with 'Hybrid Intelligence' Combining Local and Cloud AI",
    summary_en: "Although the market had anticipated that the Copilot+ PC brand would gradually fade, Microsoft re-emphasized the importance of Copilot+ PCs during the Windows and Surface event on October 7th, through a statement by Pavan Davuluri. Microsoft announced that Copilot+ PCs will feature 'Hybrid Intelligence,' allowing Copilot to distribute AI tasks between local and cloud environments. This technology provides three key local capabilities: Local context, Local actions, and Local models. This enables Copilot not only to understand local files and activities but also to perform actions on behalf of the user, such as moving files or changing settings, and to utilize local computing resources to reduce reliance on cloud APIs, thereby saving on token usage. This shift positions the Copilot+ PC as a 'personal computer for everyday AI,' rather than merely a hardware specification equipped with an NPU. However, Microsoft cautioned that specific features and availability still depend on the device, market, and chip platform, and users should be mindful of the differences across various Copilot+ PCs.",
    tags_en: ["Copilot+ PC", "Microsoft", "Windows 11", "Hybrid Intelligence", "NPU", "AI"],
