    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "俄羅斯資安駭客 UAC-0099 升級 MatchBoil 惡意程式，鎖定烏克蘭能源與製造業",
    summary: "資安廠商 ESET 分析指出，一個被追蹤為 UAC-0099 的網路間諜行為者，正在持續優化其名為 MatchBoil 的惡意程式下載器。該下載器用於傳遞 MatchWok，這是一個提供持久存取權限的 C# 後門。UAC-0099 專門針對烏克蘭的交通、製造和能源等關鍵產業進行攻擊。MatchBoil 的進化非常迅速，從最初的「一次性下載器」發展成具備強大混淆、沙盒檢查和複雜持久化機制的高級下載器。攻擊者利用 spear-phishing 郵件和 VBScript 載荷誘騙使用者執行，成功植入 MatchBoil。新版本採用 Eziriz .NET Reactor 等商業工具進行混淆，並不斷改變持久化方式（如從登錄檔/排程任務切換到 Run key 再切回排程任務），甚至能每兩分鐘執行一次，極難被防禦系統偵測。這顯示 UAC-0099 具備持續且高度專業的攻擊能力。",
    tags: ["UAC-0099", "MatchBoil", "MatchWok", "惡意程式", "網路間諜", "烏克蘭"],
    title_en: "Russian Cyber Hackers Upgrade UAC-0099 to MatchBoil Malware, Targeting Ukrainian Energy and Manufacturing Sectors",
    summary_en: "Cybersecurity vendor ESET analyzed that a network spy tracked as UAC-0099 is continuously optimizing its malware downloader named MatchBoil. This downloader is used to deliver MatchWok, a C# backdoor that provides persistent access. UAC-0099 specifically targets critical industries in Ukraine, such as transportation, manufacturing, and energy. MatchBoil has evolved rapidly, transforming from an initial 'one-time downloader' into an advanced downloader featuring strong obfuscation, sandbox checks, and complex persistence mechanisms. Attackers trick users into executing the payload using spear-phishing emails and VBScript loaders, successfully implanting MatchBoil. The new version utilizes commercial tools like Eziriz .NET Reactor for obfuscation and constantly changes its persistence methods (e.g., switching from registry/scheduled tasks to Run keys and back to scheduled tasks), even executing every two minutes, making it extremely difficult for defense systems to detect. This demonstrates that UAC-0099 possesses continuous and highly professional attack capabilities.",
    tags_en: ["UAC-0099", "MatchBoil", "MatchWok", "Malware", "Network Spy", "Ukraine"],
