    id: "20261008-15152",
    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "AI滲透測試工具 ARTEX 攻擊韓國金融機構：利用 LLM 進行資料外洩與帳號接管",
    summary: "資安研究人員揭露一場針對韓國金融機構的定向攻擊活動，攻擊者利用名為 ARTEX 的開源 AI 滲透測試工具，結合大型語言模型（LLMs）進行資料外洩。該活動從 2026 年 9 月底至 10 月初活躍，目標包括新韓銀行（Shinhan Bank）和 Yegaram Savings Bank 等韓國金融公司。攻擊者利用 ARTEX 系統，其後端使用 DeepSeek v4.1-flash，並輔助使用 GLM-5.3 和 Grok 4.6 等模型。攻擊者透過在香港 IP 位址發現的目錄，暴露了 Claude Code 的會話紀錄和 ARTEX 配置檔案。除了進行滲透測試外，攻擊者還詢問 Claude 如何尋找韓國資料外洩資訊的交易群組。ARTEX 的開發者 Autumn-27 因工具被濫用，已宣布將其轉為閉源，不再提供更新和維護支援。此外，另有報告指出，另一類利用 AI 進行帳號接管的平台（如 SCARLET LOOP）也存在，該平台能自動化從目標發現到使用竊取憑證進行登入的整個流程，顯示 AI 工具在資安領域的濫用風險極高。",
    tags: ["ARTEX", "LLM", "AI 滲透測試", "韓國金融機構", "資料外洩", "DeepSeek v4.1-flash", "帳號接管"],
    title_en: "AI Penetration Testing Tool ARTEX Attacks South Korean Financial Institutions: Exploiting LLMs for Data Leakage and Account Takeover",
    summary_en: "Cybersecurity researchers have exposed a targeted attack campaign against South Korean financial institutions. The attackers utilized an open-source AI penetration testing tool called ARTEX, combining it with Large Language Models (LLMs) to facilitate data leakage. This activity was active from late September to early October 2026, targeting South Korean financial companies including Shinhan Bank and Yegaram Savings Bank. The attackers used the ARTEX system, which utilized DeepSeek v4.1-flash in its backend, and was further assisted by models such as GLM-5.3 and Grok 4.6. Through a directory found via a Hong Kong IP address, the attackers exposed conversation records of Claude Code and ARTEX configuration files. Beyond conducting penetration testing, the attackers also queried Claude on how to find transaction groups leaking Korean data. Due to the misuse of the tool, ARTEX's developer, Autumn-27, has announced that the tool will be transitioned to closed source, ceasing further updates and maintenance support. Furthermore, another report indicated the existence of a different type of platform that uses AI for account takeover (such as SCARLET LOOP). This platform can automate the entire process from target discovery to logging in using stolen credentials, highlighting the extremely high risk of AI tool misuse in the cybersecurity domain.",
    tags_en: ["ARTEX", "LLM", "AI Penetration Testing", "South Korean Financial Institutions", "Data Leakage", "DeepSeek v4.1-flash", "Account Takeover"],
