    id: "20261008-15236",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Android",
    title: "Amazon推出全新Alexa平板系列，首次支援Google Play商店，取代Fire代號",
    summary: "Amazon宣布推出全新三款Alexa平板系列，旨在取代過去的Fire代號，並大幅提升產品定位。這三款平板分別為8.7吋、11吋和12吋Pro型號，設計上具備鋁金屬機身，並在價格上具備市場競爭力。最大的亮點是，新系列首次全面支援Google Mobile Services (GMS) 和Google Play商店，解決了以往Fire平板生態系統缺乏主流應用程式支援的痛點。入門級的Alexa Tablet 8配備MediaTek 8189處理器，而旗艦的12吋Alexa Tablet 12 Pro則搭載MediaTek Dimensity 8400處理器，並提供高達16GB RAM和256GB儲存選項。雖然產品設計被認為是iPad的仿製品，但其在軟體層面回歸標準Android系統，讓用戶可以更順暢地使用主流應用程式，對於追求完整Android體驗的用戶來說，是重大的升級。建議關注其系統更新和UI介面設計，以確保最佳的使用體驗。",
    tags: ["Amazon", "Alexa Tablets", "Google Play Store", "Android", "MediaTek", "平板電腦"],
    title_en: "Amazon Launches New Alexa Tablet Line, Replacing the Fire Brand",
    summary_en: "Amazon has announced a new lineup of three Alexa tablets, designed to replace the previous Fire branding and significantly elevate the product's market positioning. These three tablets are available in 8.7-inch, 11-inch, and 12-inch Pro models, featuring aluminum alloy bodies and maintaining market-competitive pricing. The biggest highlight is that the new series fully supports Google Mobile Services (GMS) and the Google Play Store for the first time, addressing the long-standing pain point of the Fire tablet ecosystem lacking support for mainstream applications. The entry-level Alexa Tablet 8 is equipped with the MediaTek 8189 processor, while the flagship 12-inch Alexa Tablet 12 Pro features the MediaTek Dimensity 8400 processor and offers options up to 16GB RAM and 256GB storage. Although the product design is considered an imitation of the iPad, its return to a standard Android operating system at the software level allows users to run mainstream applications more smoothly, making it a major upgrade for users seeking a complete Android experience. Users are advised to monitor system updates and UI design to ensure the best possible user experience.",
    tags_en: ["Amazon", "Alexa Tablets", "Google Play Store", "Android", "MediaTek", "Tablet Computer"],
