    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Apple高層變動：任命新併購主管與App Store副總，強化服務部門領導陣容",
    summary: "根據彭博社的報導，Apple進行了多項高層人事變動。公司任命Steve Smith接任新的併購與收購（M&A）主管，取代了原任Adrian Perica。Smith將向CFO Kevan Parekh匯報。原M&A主管Perica則轉向Apple服務部門，擔任更為核心的職位，並將直接向服務部門主管Eddy Cue匯報。市場觀察指出，Perica和Apple Music主管Oliver Schusser被視為未來接替Eddy Cue的潛在候選人。此外，Apple還升遷了Carson Oliver擔任App Store副總，向Cue匯報。這些變動顯示Apple正在重組其服務部門和企業發展戰略，特別是強化了其在服務生態系統中的領導力。",
    tags: ["Apple", "M&A", "App Store", "服務部門", "高層變動"],
    title_en: "Apple Executive Shakeup: New M&A Lead and App Store VP Appointed, Strengthening Service Division Leadership",
    summary_en: "According to a report by Bloomberg, Apple has implemented several high-level personnel changes. The company has appointed Steve Smith as the new Head of Mergers and Acquisitions (M&A), replacing Adrian Perica. Smith will report to CFO Kevan Parekh. The former M&A lead, Perica, has transitioned to the Apple Services division, taking on a more core role and reporting directly to Services head Eddy Cue. Market observers suggest that Perica and Apple Music head Oliver Schusser are potential candidates to succeed Eddy Cue. Furthermore, Apple promoted Carson Oliver to Vice President of the App Store, who will report to Cue. These changes indicate that Apple is restructuring its services division and corporate development strategy, particularly strengthening its leadership within the services ecosystem.",
